<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>We are a &#8220;smaller reporting company&#8221; under applicable
federal securities laws and are subject to reduced public company reporting requirements. Investing in our securities involves a high
degree of risk. See the section entitled &#8220;<A HREF="#a_002">Risk Factors</A>&#8221; beginning on page 5.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</P>

