    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Represents shares subject to outstanding stock options and warrants currently exercisable or exercisable within 60 days.</FONT></TD></TR>
