    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Mr. Thornton is our Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer. He beneficially owns 100,825 shares of common stock and 57,322 shares of common stock issuable upon the exercise of options currently exercisable or exercisable within 60 days.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
