  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&#160;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">no action can be taken by stockholders except at an annual or special meeting of the stockholders called in accordance with our amended and restated bylaws, as amended, and stockholders may not act by written consent;</FONT></TD></TR>
