<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The validity of any securities offered by this prospectus will be passed
upon for us by Burns &amp; Levinson LLP. Blank Rome LLP, New York, New York, is acting as counsel to the placement agent in connection
